# Python tooling

Use **uv** for all Python work. Never invoke bare `python`, `pip`, `poetry`, or `conda`.

## Dev checks

```bash
uv sync
uv run python scripts/dev.py check    # full gate
uv run python scripts/dev.py lint     # ruff check
uv run python scripts/dev.py fmt      # ruff format
uv run python scripts/dev.py types    # mypy
uv run python scripts/dev.py test     # pytest
uv run python scripts/dev.py arch     # architecture rules
uv run python scripts/dev.py doctor   # verify install / hooks
uv run iopenpod                       # run the app
```

## Linting

- **ruff** only — do not run flake8, black, isort, or pylint
- Config: `pyproject.toml` (`[tool.ruff]`, `[tool.mypy]`)

## Before marking work done

Run `uv run python scripts/dev.py lint` and targeted tests at minimum.
